          h2(class='video-detail-page__hot-title') 热门推荐

        ul(class='video-detail-page__hot-list')
          each _ in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
            li
              a(class='video-detail-page__hot-card' href='video_detail.html?id=1')
                div(class='video-detail-page__hot-aspect')
                  div(class='video-detail-page__hot-poster')
                    img(class='video-detail-page__hot-img' src='/static/frontend/images/loading.svg' alt='')
                div(class='video-detail-page__hot-body')
                  div(class='video-detail-page__hot-name') SONE-306 | 花アリス | Alice in Kimesekrando - 虾扭曲的充满春药的不间断性爱，不断摇晃G乳房让你射精
                  div(class='video-detail-page__hot-meta')
                    span(class='video-detail-page__hot-time') 5小时前
                    div(class='video-detail-page__hot-stats')
                      div(class='video-detail-page__hot-stat')
                        svg(class='video-detail-page__hot-stat-icon' aria-hidden='true')
                          use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#view')
                        span 3.3M
                      div(class='video-detail-page__hot-stat')
                        svg(class='video-detail-page__hot-stat-icon' aria-hidden='true')
                          use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#like')
                        span 259

block dialog
  include includes/dialog/dx-reply-dialog.pug
  include includes/dialog/dx-comment-dialog.pug
  include includes/dialog/dx-report-dialog.pug


block footer-scripts
  script(data-main='/static/frontend/js/video_detail_main.js' src="/static/frontend/js/lib/require.js")

